# southwest) so those scenarios read as forest fires, not fires sitting in
# open sand. Each is placed 2.5-4m from its site - close enough to read as
# "in the forest" in camera, far enough to keep collision clearance (see the
# near forest cluster's comment above for why that clearance matters) and to
